      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 8.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.8,
      "end_seconds": 13.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "I wanted to get a metallic taste before it looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.24,
      "end_seconds": 25.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.55,
      "end_seconds": 31.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.11,
      "end_seconds": 36.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "any an odd smell before it as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.79,
      "end_seconds": 39.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.36,
      "end_seconds": 43.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Have you had staring spells that others noticed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.64,
      "end_seconds": 48.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.54,
      "end_seconds": 56.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, head injury or losing control of the bladder?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.5,
      "end_seconds": 60.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.51,
      "end_seconds": 64.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Any jerking movements or tongue biting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.34,
      "end_seconds": 71.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, no jerking movements or tongue biting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.83,
      "end_seconds": 76.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.2,
      "end_seconds": 80.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.03,
      "end_seconds": 83.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.05,
      "end_seconds": 90.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.28,
      "end_seconds": 109.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.4,
      "end_seconds": 119.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning. I look after my grandchildren most days. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.4,
      "end_seconds": 123.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.97,
      "end_seconds": 131.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.98,
      "end_seconds": 147.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.19,
      "end_seconds": 150.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "I have anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.27,
      "end_seconds": 154.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "so, any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.94,
      "end_seconds": 156.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.49,
      "end_seconds": 167.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "okay, go on okay, I can see anxiety and eczema in your file as well any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.35,
      "end_seconds": 175.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I had an operation for a hernia last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.7,
      "end_seconds": 181.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.34,
      "end_seconds": 185.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 185.87,
      "end_seconds": 198.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "Okay, so the the vitals from earlier. Pulse 84, temperature is 36.8 degrees, oxygen saturation is 99 percent. Blood pressure 121 over 73, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.18,
      "end_seconds": 200.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.96,
      "end_seconds": 206.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "could you come over to to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.63,
      "end_seconds": 210.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.46,
      "end_seconds": 229.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Coordination is normal on finger-to-nose testing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.51,
      "end_seconds": 242.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Putting it all together, my working impression is a possible focal seizure that needs investigating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.55,
      "end_seconds": 252.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Let me think, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.62,
      "end_seconds": 265.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible focal seizure that needs investigating is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.04,
      "end_seconds": 305.57,
      "duration_seconds": 22.53,
      "text": "Blood tests is what I'd like next, for episode of altered awareness don't drive until we've looked into this please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach i'll want another look after the results are back right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.82,
      "end_seconds": 309.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
